  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Carnival 2012 Spring was held at four venues on five days: Sendai Sun Plaza Hall on 3 May, Pacifico Yokohama on 12 and 13 May, Port Messe Nagoya on 20 May and Intex Osaka on 3 June 2012. Its main tournament, the World Challenge Tournament, was played in two leagues, and everyone who entered got Purrloin and Kyurem stamped with the event's logo. After the Challenge Stage and a Premier Stage of winning streaks, the top 16 of each league played a single-elimination Climax Stage; its top three won Victory Cup in the print for their place, in an acrylic shield, and each league's winner was invited to the 2012 World Championships.",
